============================================================

### ShopManager::Config ###
Each <Shop> maps one NPC to a shop Index.
  Index          Shop id. Must match the corresponding file's leading
                 number in Data/Shop/ (e.g. Index="0" matches
                 "000 - ....txt"). Do not change for existing shops.
  MonsterClass   NPC class that opens this shop when talked to.
  Map            -1 = any map (matched by MonsterClass alone). A real
                 map number pins this shop to one specific NPC instance
                 at X/Y, for cases where the same NPC class exists more
                 than once (e.g. a test/duplicate spawn).
  X/Y            -1 = any position. Only meaningful together with Map.
  AccountLevel   -1 = no restriction. N = minimum VIP AccountLevel (0-3)
                 required to open this shop.
  GameMaster     0 = anyone can open this shop, 1 = Game Master required,
                 2 = Administrator required.
  GensFamily     -1 = no restriction, 1 = Vanert required, 2 = Duprian
                 required.
  GensContribution  Minimum GensContribution required (0 = no minimum),
                 only checked when GensFamily != -1.
  Class          -1 = no restriction, otherwise the player's base
                 class/race (ignoring evolution stage) must equal this
                 value: 0=DW family, 16=DK family, 32=Elf family,
                 48=MG family, 64=DL family, 80=SU family.
  MinReset/MaxReset  0/0 = no minimum/no maximum Reset count required.
  MinMasterReset/MaxMasterReset  0/0 = no minimum/no maximum Master
                 Reset count required.
  Name           Free-text label, for readability only (not read by
                 the loader).

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

